{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kouSteinerTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"terminals"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/SteinerTree","text":"SteinerTree","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees11SteinerTreeV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">? "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"terminals","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices to connect.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"weight","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each edge’s weight, from its position.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tree’s edges, in position order, and their total weight."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Dijkstra search from each terminal gives the distances between terminals; a minimum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spanning tree of that complete distance graph is expanded into its shortest paths; and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tree is a minimum spanning tree of those paths’ edges with every leaf that is not a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"terminal pruned, repeatedly. Its weight is at most 2(1 − 1\/ℓ) times the optimum, where ℓ is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the number of leaves of an optimal tree."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Repeated terminals count once. With fewer than two terminals the tree has no edges. Every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge that is not a self-loop is weighed once; ","type":"text"},{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not kept.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(t (m + n) log n + t²) for t terminals, with O(t n) memory."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every terminal is a vertex; every weight is at least zero and not NaN; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path lengths do not overflow."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An approximate minimum Steiner tree connecting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"terminals"},{"type":"text","text":", by the algorithm of Kou,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Markowsky and Berman; nil when two terminals are in different components."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/kousteinertree(terminals:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kouSteinerTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"terminals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text